        <p><strong>No wear detection.</strong> Take them off and the music keeps going. Every rival at this price manages it; the X3 doesn't. It's the single most daily annoyance in an otherwise excellent package.</p>
        <p><strong>The app is a beta in disguise.</strong> EQ changes apply with a half-second lag, and the firmware updater failed once during our test (a reboot fixed it). Aura ships updates often, so this may improve — but we review what's in front of us.</p>
